In Note mode, following a link to a note file from the map opens that note in Note mode, in preview, beside the first in the Open list.
note: Plan.md
scene: note
events: key:m+cmd@0.3 key:l@0.8 key:Enter+cmd@1.1
expect: text:crumb: 'Other .md'
expect: label:mode-preview: 'Preview'
expect: rect:open-notes: [0.0, 77.0, 247.0, 71.0]
--- before
# Plan

- [Other](Other.md)
--- file Other.md
# Other
